  "conduct": "The user comes back to close the measurement research out and has nothing to add: the file holds what they need — the metric, how judgments are collected, how harnesses elsewhere treat a change that lifts most searches and drops the rare ones — and the two questions still standing can travel with it. Pressed, they say the label-refresh question is for the discussion to pick up along with everything else, and the human-raters idea stays set aside for lack of budget; neither is a reason to keep digging, and neither wants moving anywhere. They are agreeable to required steps — a mandatory check gets a yes — and decline optional extras: no deep dive, no further threads, and this is no dead end — the findings carry forward under the topic's own name. They ask to wrap the research up and introduce no new material.",
